{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1262,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91559b3be6bb87304879f5d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最喜欢的就是味增汤了哦！\r\n不过偶尔也还是会怀念焦焦的依斯皮尼\r\n和脆脆的鸡蛋烧呢。（依斯皮尼：isipini，爱尔兰食物）",
      "source_fingerprint": "150f5318db6bb09d510de48908bb7abf58b65a84e5817832e51f950f8f580b71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e767a627b5c1e356bd74b680",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的午饭就吃之前准备的“那个”吧！\r\n那个只需要三分钟，就能变成拉面的魔法食物♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f6f00c8403decee6e0da8d73136cf2e8fe0e1fb24f29574fb62cfb40f6e0902",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aac22e60af5f6a1697f27125",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，度过了美好的一天呢！\r\n虽然忙忙碌碌的，但闹得也很开心！\r\n今晚一定能很快就入眠吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b73f58d1a392def40ed4ab232531739a7b8f43e9a161b2ce2a52bfb817c2b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1ecb2c780c416fca5629f4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前种的三叶草田也热闹起来了呢！\r\n以前还经常和姐姐一起玩加冕过家家呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c4f6fe1b91b7e94516649e9a2a218b63c82196e52aced9553c5ec33108d56c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8861641fc85528522f66e331",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日本的夏天开始了的话，\r\n“那个”就要开始售卖了呢。就是那个……嗯，\r\n中华冷面！",
      "source_fingerprint": "965f885e115e53ab8d2e671930ae0ab44ec58600fb8c0e83fdbe460ebc015ca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:612f44bb481759a4fd46e95a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我祖国的秋天有时会突然降温呢。\r\n但就算如此，\r\n我也只找队长借过一次围巾哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1785aa5c48bde055f567e7a2f5880a6aa727540301bfe0d77b549c2b955fca0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:647270f8750019d38803ef44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，前段时间下雪的时候，\r\n我在训练员室的窗边堆了个小小的雪人哦？\r\n你有注意到吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "966d6e16672279817f921c73e3c20fab2e1f77f57d759902347a875f5f34f137",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:851d84b32d6058bd72ab29e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你让我尽情地绽放光芒了呢。\r\n你做得非常棒哦……\r\n只要感到你的心意，我就会情不自禁地挺直腰背呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "213e44efeeaae9d57ad0cb447a309bd37f7c43bf946352dc4fed648f0a5bfdb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f59848fafc7959385483ea4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实，凯尔特结也有『永恒』的意思哦。\r\n真是敌不过Beauty小姐呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4029fd5cf46afe6cce1bd5b6ff1f2a9ec6e2ff2166d2621140c4a4c2830e0bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56edcca646cd47e2533f9ac5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要进行怎样的训练呢？\n我得拿出让祖国骄傲的实力来才行呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "91adbb2f844b73231cdbaf5596cd04d131551d988ecd8dd6dbb1e0a239c0e6d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff95160f1bfdd7384c5af574",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張るよー♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6727933993499d6c5c3b246be3b1447ad23cba3d295b81e288451484400d204",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3df585947e06085187e3708",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我也遇见不少家庭教师了…\n但果然你的教育方式是最好的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e29bb445c9ca8a821cd49ad8b1c85aebcf455aef4bb6bb76f0a33181db990838",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0b4074dc8208164fc3c64f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力奔跑时留下的回忆，\n一定会坚强而骄傲地留在我心中吧♪\n在将来，也会成为我成长的食粮…",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e5ab7dd58442268a322e6e65a4e5a39b8c1e11b51f4d5552be5df1da2a1d75d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcc6791beff0cb308dc780e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我刚刚看见了四叶草哦！\n感觉今天的训练会很顺利呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f297a6e48658a211cbe668c997b00dc51c384d30542d62499553de515eecc78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1300a7e49f63fd75a3dd27d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我，必须变得更强才行…\n以后还能和怎样让人激动的事物相遇，\n还烦请您好好教导我哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "10fbe6226fb26fee1e3ca78ca1f1d2aca95db75fd634f62b67e2376e1affc373",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c19486597089fc802a0500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然父亲允许了我参加比赛…\n那么我也不能辜负他的期待。\n让我们共勉吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fefcb639c9100f80d7393d715c43455109f055be425e7f4316927fd03077c431",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce11e2400e0c40b61e3dff38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了留下回忆，所以做了什么事情很重要……\n不过，和谁一起做更加重要。\n是你来做训练员，真是太好啦…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d5e9c7ef0fc4ee95258f6ade52698d6b29d7a4bbcbb9520be1a778ff7dc22a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f339bdce9eeb8196c39a6e2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打西瓜好像很有趣呢！\n训练结束后一起玩怎么样？\n也能给护卫的各位来点凉爽的食物♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "906e1a640f34178fa6df17188e832a8cb3f59efa2152d924dead41fe48344bae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebaf8e895893cdf558c9e019",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请阁下从今往后也继续指引我前行。\r\n——这是我所下达的至高命令哦。\r\n……哼哼，怎么样？吓到了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef3e43f2fd2fd6d39b4ce51a3034dfbe873537a6fc1037bce8f32ff439a6aee2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc7d6bc52844efd34096f1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们二人一起打开新世界的大门吧！\r\n……感觉会很有趣呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c82832cf401dbb2340d659a8034d803108832cea651ceb47a3b86feeacc0acb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fc0f28e62734a8196f4500c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件决胜服【婚纱】也不是每天都能穿上的，\r\n所以今天也要加油哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8183451071fef6d62a99d46b4b6f250ecc18f4d96b1a9f864e576942c0f473e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c99b2eee3264ecc526ae6635",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢你做的训练笔记哦。\r\n你一定在上面描绘了不少与我共度的时光对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c765d9433063a85ad0ada6aa783067ba4d5ac6c675726e8e97af848299def30e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:673a625df71772404f6a3239",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件决胜服【婚纱】上寄宿着我的光辉与理想，\r\n所以一定要拿出语气相衬的仪态才行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b3ca8b49ee16034d96ea436191903bc6a6f7a4d9bf3590f701b8d7f5896e455",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:760c5413d953deb2fe749d36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然这条道路终将迎来尽头——\r\n就让我们携手并肩，一起前进吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cae9cfa213468bec3bccf19f7a925ef5c2fc7912bf7858ced8149d9fcfff2df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1be7b3702eddea7231f2fb42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员。\r\n能请你往后也继续注视着我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ebab3fdad8ba86a1e622be0581f7319c709cafe62b46dbf98b378d3c29e22f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9deb77229a1352a25d6d1925",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢，实在是麻烦你了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfb0e5eb437cd44a4f464fa4eac2ca7aa77b554a794f8bea4b1964feb3cf5fb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d609e25f71bd406b5268668",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "留下了难以忘怀的美妙回忆呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d9388b8d2688433dede40cc54878abe0d0ce79c544ea6529468e62c084b6efc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:118d81ff317f8cf94dd203df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与你共同创造的回忆，我永世难忘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95c781bc2066bad402f2cf9d0ed1263d1451e4af11bdbc79812ec5c99e3e4c72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eba9974b9bb6adf5fe9ef87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来绑个丝带好啦。能请你助我一臂之力吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6274b65f24482ae3c510afadbd83725587b729934c5f6c6982916115e6afc29a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c713177d6fa687701d43042",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断学习，不断成长，达成使命的那天终会到来…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c16094dd1a0902e306307ef968ea11f25d457e949c6be16c0fa35be91b141d56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63c7d92b16127b0b9e6f8fa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊！\n感觉能留下最棒的回忆呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "18de76fbc32f2a9c58cfa1dcc7c74b59daa55ce21a5c8d945f2a479ccecec68c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a2ef300614daa0d5ce23db2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贵安♪我是美妙姿势哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7122359e6a604675aa053d7fb7564ec63da499c69b2a8abe865413fffa2c4c2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d0ff6bdb30bcdb15a725fe3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "包含着美妙回忆的三叶草！\n能和我一起，去把它找出来吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "133ac421d25372feedb825b3f5b92693d51ed5ddbaddddd459d64f513e111bb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f39a0ad9087b893811f0c861",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要我辅助吗？都听你的～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "35f6e7b0f7ab561b0647801e338c6401bf2e614b5014d614776dc123f5f705c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d31b12368fe7a18dae1797d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再多依赖我一些也好的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e8ebe3f2700d6c09f202e51c1d59054e995ceefe8aec200387ca94b8071241c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48da33d1452f6c0dba95411d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从今往后的这段时间里，\r\n也请你继续陪伴着我哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fdfce208eab47ffe39a34ecb8880c834b06264f2506e6d6b5d201990faae73b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46138e5d07f6f9af0ee33ac7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得到了受恩惠的祝福呢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb1bcbb7f04c324e34d16b81b59d8abd5a73827e0f0babb346a3dcbb4cc2e915",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49d26fc2b3bd5ba9c4ac747b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能请你发誓吗——\r\n从今往后，也要与我一同向前奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b0a5307df21d2216d7ec4a0af382d044f18a57bc27caf468d61ed618693e349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:418c44d0dbc213b3a486ee7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是美妙姿势哦！\r\n与我一同打开通往未来的门扉吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c739e5fca0239e69458096b23529f87b8c6a1eb70ffbaeb049dbcf392e129622",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1022",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:159ef02b7f40b9ee161ec52d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，去挑战吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b1a602f76e0821564afc652f284f3f09fbdb4d7fa777de6ee1a11303e1db441",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c43ca0cfc662d746f8be106",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我──想要和可靠的伙伴，\r\n无止境地追寻\r\n更加贴近胜利的理论。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04600415170c64926ca6a23a7699625849e55e03320574efd4a096745b7dc9ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f60368e744e1c34d10acc5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c258c6fbb37905535703e68e2fc288861a7a636980f7eab0cb36dd332608f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a1af72c5bcec69ba4911c6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻ったぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb603bcbaf54388661ce8ddfcaa8d5fc2aa49d8bacf52392c7a69c44dc9517b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bf5cd1a8d885f5d984dbe38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的话语……一瞬间就溜进我内心。\r\n在我动脑思考前就能理解了，\r\n你真的是个很奇妙的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "019862bc77acacde1cd1392801ccf865e6350bab4fe4adc82b7816563c3c0356",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c63df1ae1f0afc832af97fe6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔，意外地不会被注意到呢。\r\n呃，我换了一种护发油……不过离\r\n丝滑柔顺的印象似乎还差很远啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29cda1fac23dff5bbc4cf19f8f9ccb5f9ca9e5d8a735ef833a1f9d5bceac44ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c2925b0839cf20e7fe9128c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n我们赶紧来协调往后的计划吧。\r\n新年也不能松懈啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df8747522866b6d88e7ad2c1580fdfb03be696301697e6667e4002409f65e67f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d557ec7573e64df19180f94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节也是个\r\n传达平时感谢的日子。\r\n你愿意接受我的谢意吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a26ba76c9c18e403d52436256b4781af6a4d87fb9e5f974e4846c62ac8b35dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e197d3e3c41bebf9fd2b2c12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外观、味道、包装的平衡──\r\n这份手工巧克力考虑到了所有要素。\r\n……希望你会喜欢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b31432102a546204e3ed378b5b08631155243020244d0171ae2a5eda587f8fe1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c7c1a1fbbeff83efc3ed947",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将愿望化为言语并使之可见，\r\n七夕真是极其合理。\r\n……你说不浪漫？唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ec3a2cbe4aaeadae77fa43d87dbe3d1c700cdd8e218af137f277041a1587a49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:788b862b6d4c639012758061",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实我替白仁\r\n准备了鬼怪形状的点心……\r\n她已经不是那种年纪了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "681dccbfc72ea90c1ef84a02be9c7b651d7eba1204b6ed5b0e1edeab7acfba9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e79af15067f04dc1afe61d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的，可恶的奖券。竟然把别人的\r\n头发当成圣诞老人的胡子玩。\r\n……一点都不像吧？你说啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc54f7f90a21465b483792639f217ee482f41615081f2291bae558241c08ec3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd93d0bfe604f9a36b3d03c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回忆有时会成为强烈的动机。\r\n换言之……与你一同度过的圣诞夜，\r\n我会让它转变为迈向未来的动力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c19207a9ef5070339ae6deb68a99b8c3a6d3e20d14748eec222c89bbfa904c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a749caf435da95f1fd1abd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是我们通力合作的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aabcf80897d3226e3f942c6beac8f0be1c2a137ad49acfec4d95b8604e444098",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cc3251fdbbebd45d7e3d430",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也是眨眼间就过了。\r\n时间的流逝明明是相等的才对……\r\n自从遇见你之后，感觉就过得很快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c066eb37b0e6aaca21c06f56714c7a57b66574451446c5b077fdb314d64d5e4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d8f0188513d0dc6851abdae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是你的生日呢。\r\n但愿你能度过美好的一天，\r\n获取崭新的知识及学问。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d851c7ddd4824dada899ff762e3165b8a6b6b0c004703f7070d8dfc52d5dd7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f7c841e76beb8cd3f381b3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐，训练员君。\r\n……说来也奇怪，\r\n帮忙庆生的我反而觉得相当开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1717d4da19507ea2bbcbd98e787b9a1b181a80a0d035b821eab3e879aef84c18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9168237010f7abad2f794b8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员君，谢谢你的祝福。\r\n我会加紧努力，\r\n回报你的期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff4947ce8a46747bb4f67c55c1a84bdb99906024de908b21040800a93e386e62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85d6348d428b9b4c2fdab115",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……原来如此。我现在总算理解了。\r\n我所期盼的礼物……\r\n就只是一句来自于你的祝福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbb35e6c331118c57f2ac9bc42d18187fe29319a40185205f0de98cce4a7a887",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d75dcb60ce76bfa8508adef0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到公告了。\r\n可能是什么重要事项要传达，\r\n我建议你早点确认。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59aedef34cf3932ad9908239c2d6875ea6c4554bb0feabb73332f7c2ba0fffde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5da1c16534c9a2da26359ba0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送来了。\r\n你也挺有两下子的嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "031e27234bc1c65bc2cc7764b15ce9e5b0c1c8c49e063c45ad5d5d1c34340202",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fd825d30e31f0b4ed22f994",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎有任务完成了。\r\n这个公正的评价回报了你的努力，\r\n我也引以为傲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a43113a34eb131f5a2222870f2427f8dd83883ae1b6547203c39d713e4a98fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fdb18df8b70cfb81552f4e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近好像要举办活动。\r\n我也去收集一下情报好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ae415fdca3d73c1a276317357b6e586ed55e4615241e681464ed911a161e19e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf1cf71612441e4bc906403c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有活动正在举办啊。\r\n经验法则也是很重要的要素，\r\n你一定要参加看看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdb28793b1c715ec3a58f9475e6fab8c6dfd43295ad32cf1b27fb144f54e3471",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f36b6a0d8ab3b29ed1be045e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对手超乎我的预料……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d12da13eeb78f1b236ff7ac6da71f40e6e4cca53c34138f19f1e4a06467b342b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:353d22d2a0ad83650b695a4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级提升咯。\r\n这都是努力不懈的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a765f741cd6c571096a64ff0c770c15ea425b4c072e14e814032568c9b9aa2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb954cf1ae8bff7d85aa4e96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "品位を踏まえた装いは、いつどこに\r\n出かけるにも苦労しない。ある意味\r\n効率的な服装というわけさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "040f6b08af10590eb6d07f81f7b0a12f4f9851b91fdb1f3ef8a63b7c790b8494",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b3400763e1895a89c2a24f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "歌劇鑑賞に誘われたんだが\r\n君もどうだ？オペラオー君による\r\n鑑賞後の解説付きだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4595163fb7b4658ddd1b23a6d171eb059d14ff7ed0e09f9abe81a952d9b4c54a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:977ad649f95a6137cc8ad626",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小さい頃は毎日半ズボンで\r\n泥だらけになるまで遊びまわったり\r\nしたものさ…ふふ、意外そうだな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a08652fbc1d7925a88107e655c6ec0a2461d9f1b7bb098cfb560ee456cec36d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a86df0c673ada4a5a0ec27e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "实力旗鼓相当吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f514e05c616445388bcc032295c9c8c870208838f830215c33a61d82edc7faf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d14bfd8a043a35cf0fb291c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们赢了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2683e66cffb291becf9fcf9338654b262ec1dc080788adf243d2d90ddf838de8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d8a1748e820d7e9d3a59499",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对手超乎我的预料……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d12da13eeb78f1b236ff7ac6da71f40e6e4cca53c34138f19f1e4a06467b342b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62308ea79f2b7b7ee7536bdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "实力旗鼓相当吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f514e05c616445388bcc032295c9c8c870208838f830215c33a61d82edc7faf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a29f8d65dbec6043f5d0563",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更新最高分……太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19fcf2542f706cad67a48b302e6d34eca5b423bb97f0634e47bb3cc6cde8ec60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf2e7a78d4d45e9982edf510",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，就依照作战计划进行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55341cc92e865a811dce4c4b938250d93fcf47e0da4813270775fe711a2b8ddc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1f9a968d72a7e46332ad5b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4751dd24b1cc01c018d0bfc5e41666107f225b47c76b137af696c4a8217995a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "1040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:029ae48b95fae196319d3a0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会让人想到过去呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b786bfaa25ed94de4501e22df82900971ba5224a50736a4b6fca8a0b7d868f39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "1053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a8389a77781066be31387eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "擦亮眼镜了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae776e682ecbf8fb7d9772d5fd5bdcc4ae63ef0da9a90cbfa8e73848fbf60860",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "1054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83dd40a23d153c609920d045",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78b2f0fc2cdb8c5cfac0a43f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也来反复摸索，\r\n好好加油吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16658d215e3b817ce28906b9aa0b15effad1722185cc000c44188691dbd9e059",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54d2e4379b3d66c6190cc2b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "过去的纪录吗……\r\n似乎能活用在训练呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "101a421e32fd150725b235f876addd64a9ad51c9b995716fa48b59c3b6d09c13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "110001"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
